    <description>USED IN DASHBOARD
Ability to report on the status of a product on an opportunity - Example: open, won, lost. Used for win/loss analysis: reason for, sales stage, account attributes, product attributes.</description>
    <format>Summary</format>
    <groupingsDown>
        <dateGranularity>Day</dateGranularity>
        <field>OpportunityLineItem.Core_Status__c</field>
        <sortOrder>Asc</sortOrder>
    </groupingsDown>
